{"seq":2,"slug":"axioms-vs-meaning","title":"公理与意义之别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-probability/foundations/axioms-vs-meaning","wordCount":2136,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"公理与意义之别\">公理与意义之别</h1><p>有一个反直觉的事实值得先记住：柯尔莫哥洛夫公理如此之弱，以至于「一枚硬币正面概率 0.5」与「掷这枚硬币会掉进黑洞的概率 0.5」在公理眼中毫无区别——只要数值满足可加性，公理照单全收。公理是概率的骨架，意义是它的血肉，本篇把骨架逐块拆开，看清它到底约束了什么、又刻意放过了什么，然后展示两条不预设意义就能反推出这套骨架的路径：考克斯定理与荷兰赌。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-柯尔莫哥洛夫三公理\">核心概念：柯尔莫哥洛夫三公理</h2><p>设样本空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span> 是所有可能结果的集合，事件是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span> 的子集，全体待测事件构成一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{F}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0993em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>（对补集与可数并封闭）。概率是一个函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">F</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P:\\mathcal{F}\\to\\mathbb{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0993em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6889em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>非负性</strong>：对任意事件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(A)\\ge 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>规范性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\Omega)=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>可数可加性</strong>：对两两互斥的可数事件序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_1,A_2,\\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mo>⋃</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P\\left(\\bigcup_i A_i\\right)=\\sum_i P(A_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">⋃</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>条件概率不是第四条公理，而是一个<strong>定义</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(B)&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(A\\mid B)=\\dfrac{P(A\\cap B)}{P(B)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。贝叶斯定理 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(H\\mid E)=\\dfrac{P(E\\mid H)\\,P(H)}{P(E)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只是这个定义加可加性的直接推论，它本身不携带任何解释承诺——无论你把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 读作频次还是信念度，贝叶斯定理都成立。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  O[样本空间 Omega] --&gt; F[sigma-代数 F:待测事件]&#10;  F --&gt; P[概率函数 P:F 到 实数]&#10;  P --&gt; A1[公理1 非负性 P大于等于0]&#10;  P --&gt; A2[公理2 规范性 P Omega 等于1]&#10;  P --&gt; A3[公理3 可数可加性]&#10;  A1 --&gt; D[定义:条件概率 P A given B]&#10;  A2 --&gt; D&#10;  A3 --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; B[推论:贝叶斯定理&lt;br/&gt;不含解释承诺]\">flowchart TD\n  O[样本空间 Omega] --&gt; F[sigma-代数 F:待测事件]\n  F --&gt; P[概率函数 P:F 到 实数]\n  P --&gt; A1[公理1 非负性 P大于等于0]\n  P --&gt; A2[公理2 规范性 P Omega 等于1]\n  P --&gt; A3[公理3 可数可加性]\n  A1 --&gt; D[定义:条件概率 P A given B]\n  A2 --&gt; D\n  A3 --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; B[推论:贝叶斯定理&lt;br/&gt;不含解释承诺]</pre><p>这套结构的力量在于纯形式：它没有一个字提到「随机」「相信」「倾向」。正因如此，它能被任何解释共享；也正因如此，它无法独自选出正确的解释。下表对照公理「规定了什么」与「放过了什么」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>公理规定</th>\n<th>公理放过</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>概率非负、上界为 1</td>\n<td>概率值从何而来</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>互斥事件概率可加</td>\n<td>哪个样本空间才「正确」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件概率的算法</td>\n<td>单次事件能否赋概率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>贝叶斯定理的有效性</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(H)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 先验从哪来</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>概率间的一致性</td>\n<td>不同解释间如何取舍</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"语法与语义-为什么这是逻辑学的老问题\">语法与语义：为什么这是逻辑学的老问题</h2><p>概率的解释困境，在数理逻辑里有个精确的对应：一个形式系统的<strong>语法</strong>（符号操作规则）与<strong>语义</strong>（符号所指的模型）是两层东西。皮亚诺算术的公理是语法，自然数是它的标准语义模型，但同一套公理还有非标准模型——洛文海姆-斯科伦定理保证了这一点。概率公理同理：它是语法，而频次、信念度、倾向都是它的语义模型。</p>\n<p>这个类比不是修辞。它告诉我们：指望从公理内部推出「正确解释」，就像指望从群论公理推出「群一定是整数加法」一样徒劳——公理天生允许多模型。数学哲学对形式系统与其模型关系的一般讨论，见 <a href=\"../../philosophy-of-mathematics/foundational-schools/formalism-hilbert-godel\">数学哲学 · 形式主义</a>；形式系统的语义模型概念，见 <a href=\"../../formal-logic/first-order-logic/first-order-semantics\">形式逻辑 · 一阶语义</a>。</p>\n<p>于是解释之争无法在数学内部裁决，必须诉诸数学之外的考量——可确认性、可应用性、可接纳性这三条萨尔蒙判准（见 <a href=\"why-interpret-probability\">为何要解释概率</a>），以及每种解释处理单次事件、参照类的能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反向路径之一-考克斯定理\">反向路径之一：考克斯定理</h2><p>有没有可能倒过来——不预设概率的意义，而从「合理信念度应满足的定性约束」出发，推出它必须服从概率公理？物理学家考克斯（R. T. Cox）1946 年给出了肯定答案，这条定理是主观解释的重要支柱。</p>\n<p>考克斯设一个理性主体用实数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Bel</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Bel}(A\\mid B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bel</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 表示在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 下对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的信念度，并要求这套信念度满足几条极弱的定性公设：信念度可用单调函数表示、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 与其否定的信念度之间存在函数关系（否定律）、合取信念度由某个二元函数从分量算出（合取律）。仅凭这几条加上函数的连续可微性，考克斯证明——存在一个重标度，使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Bel</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Bel}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bel</span></span></span></span></span></span> 转化后恰好满足柯尔莫哥洛夫公理与贝叶斯规则。</p>\n<p>换言之，<strong>任何满足基本一致性的信念度量，本质上就是概率</strong>。这为「概率即合理信念度」提供了独立于频次的辩护。它的软肋在于对函数连续可微的技术假设——1990 年代 Halpern 指出，在有限离散情形考克斯的原始证明有漏洞，需要额外条件。但主流看法认为，加上合理的稠密性假设后定理成立。考克斯定理如何支撑主观贝叶斯，详见 <a href=\"../subjective/subjective-bayesian\">主观贝叶斯</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反向路径之二-荷兰赌与代表定理\">反向路径之二：荷兰赌与代表定理</h2><p>第二条反向路径来自拉姆齐与德菲内蒂，走的是行为主义路线：把信念度定义为下注意愿，然后证明<strong>不服从概率公理的信念度必然导致稳输</strong>。</p>\n<p>设你对事件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的信念度是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，操作定义为你愿意以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p:(1-p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的赔率双向下注（既愿买入也愿卖出这个赌局）。德菲内蒂证明：若你的一组信念度违反可加性——比如对互斥穷尽的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lnot A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 你分别赋 0.6 与 0.6——那么存在一组赌局，每个按你自己认可的赔率成立，合起来却让你无论结果如何都净亏。这就是荷兰赌（Dutch Book）。避免荷兰赌的充要条件，恰是信念度服从柯尔莫哥洛夫公理。</p>\n<p>德菲内蒂更进一步用<strong>代表定理</strong>（representation theorem）打通了主客：若一个主体的信念度对一列事件是「可交换的」（对调顺序不改变联合信念度），那么其信念度在数学上等价于「先对一个未知客观频率参数取某个先验、再据之独立采样」。这让主观主义者能在完全不承认客观概率的前提下，重构出统计学里频率参数的全部作用。荷兰赌与可交换性是主观章的核心机制，详见 <a href=\"../subjective/subjective-bayesian\">主观贝叶斯</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Q[能否不预设意义&lt;br/&gt;反推出概率公理?] --&gt; C[考克斯路径:&lt;br/&gt;定性信念公设 到 概率]&#10;  Q --&gt; D[荷兰赌路径:&lt;br/&gt;下注意愿 加 避免稳输 到 概率]&#10;  C --&gt; R[结论:一致的信念度&lt;br/&gt;本质就是概率]&#10;  D --&gt; R&#10;  D --&gt; E[代表定理:可交换信念度&lt;br/&gt;等价于 先验加频率参数]&#10;  R --&gt; M[主观解释的辩护基石]&#10;  E --&gt; M\">flowchart TD\n  Q[能否不预设意义&lt;br/&gt;反推出概率公理?] --&gt; C[考克斯路径:&lt;br/&gt;定性信念公设 到 概率]\n  Q --&gt; D[荷兰赌路径:&lt;br/&gt;下注意愿 加 避免稳输 到 概率]\n  C --&gt; R[结论:一致的信念度&lt;br/&gt;本质就是概率]\n  D --&gt; R\n  D --&gt; E[代表定理:可交换信念度&lt;br/&gt;等价于 先验加频率参数]\n  R --&gt; M[主观解释的辩护基石]\n  E --&gt; M</pre><h2 id=\"意义如何反过来约束数学的选择\">意义如何反过来约束数学的选择</h2><p>公理放过的东西，解释必须补上，而补法会反过来影响数学建模。举一个真实分歧：<strong>可数可加性该不该要</strong>？德菲内蒂本人反对可数可加性，只接受有限可加性，因为可数可加性会禁止「在自然数上均匀取一个数」这样的先验——而主观主义者认为这种先验有时是合理的表达。于是「用哪套公理」不再是纯数学问题，它取决于你的解释立场：客观频率派可以坦然要求可数可加性，激进主观派则可能只保留有限可加性。</p>\n<p>这个例子点破了本篇的主旨：公理与意义不是「先定公理、后填意义」的单向流程，二者相互塑造。你选择的解释，会悄悄决定你愿意接受哪个版本的公理、哪种先验合法、哪个样本空间「正确」。理解这一点，才能读懂后面各章为何在同一套符号下争得不可开交。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>柯尔莫哥洛夫三公理（非负、规范、可数可加）加上条件概率的<strong>定义</strong>，构成概率的全部形式骨架；贝叶斯定理是推论，不含解释承诺。</li>\n<li>公理与意义的关系对应逻辑学中语法与语义之别：一套语法容许多个语义模型，故解释之争无法在数学内部裁决。</li>\n<li>考克斯定理从定性信念公设反推出：任何一致的信念度本质就是概率——独立于频次的主观解释辩护。</li>\n<li>荷兰赌把信念度定义为下注意愿，证明违反公理必然稳输；代表定理进一步用可交换性重建客观频率参数。</li>\n<li>意义反过来约束数学：是否接受可数可加性、哪种先验合法，都取决于解释立场，公理与意义相互塑造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"why-interpret-probability\">为何要解释概率</a>（萨尔蒙三判准）、<a href=\"../subjective/subjective-bayesian\">主观贝叶斯</a>（荷兰赌与可交换性的完整展开）、<a href=\"interpretation-taxonomy\">解释谱系</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../philosophy-of-mathematics/foundational-schools/formalism-hilbert-godel\">数学哲学 · 形式主义与哥德尔</a>（形式系统与语义模型）、<a href=\"../../formal-logic/first-order-logic/first-order-semantics\">形式逻辑 · 一阶语义</a>（语法/语义分层）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"公理与意义之别","id":"公理与意义之别"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：柯尔莫哥洛夫三公理","id":"核心概念-柯尔莫哥洛夫三公理"},{"level":2,"text":"语法与语义：为什么这是逻辑学的老问题","id":"语法与语义-为什么这是逻辑学的老问题"},{"level":2,"text":"反向路径之一：考克斯定理","id":"反向路径之一-考克斯定理"},{"level":2,"text":"反向路径之二：荷兰赌与代表定理","id":"反向路径之二-荷兰赌与代表定理"},{"level":2,"text":"意义如何反过来约束数学的选择","id":"意义如何反过来约束数学的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"为何要解释概率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-probability/foundations/why-interpret-probability"},"next":{"title":"解释谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-probability/foundations/interpretation-taxonomy"}}